  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;ST. MICHAEL'S CATHEDRAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"St. Michael's Cathedral is the site of a historic ordination ceremony in New York City."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NEW YORK CITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"New York City is the city where the ordination ceremony took place."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. RACHEL KIM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Rachel Kim is a leading expert in data analysis and a member of the ordination committee, credited with the innovative application of the 'surfacing relationships between datasets' technique."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BISHOP JAMES JOHNSON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bishop James Johnson is the presiding bishop of the ordination ceremony, highlighting the significance of the innovative technique used."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ORDINATION CEREMONY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The ordination ceremony is a significant milestone in the religious community, involving the consecration of 25 individuals as clergy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SURFACING RELATIONSHIPS BETWEEN DATASETS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Surfacing Relationships Between Datasets is a cutting-edge data analysis technique that facilitated the ordination ceremony, enabling efficient and accurate processing of data."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;US PATENT 11256687&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The filing of US patent 11256687 is a significant event that sent shockwaves through the data analysis community."&lt;SEP&gt;"US patent 11256687 is a patent filed for the 'surfacing relationships between datasets' technique, marking a significant milestone in the field of data analysis."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;REVOLUTIONARY DATA ANALYSIS TECHNIQUE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Revolutionary Data Analysis Technique, known as 'surfacing relationships between datasets,' played a crucial role in the ordination ceremony."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HISTORIC ORDINATION CEREMONY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Historic Ordination Ceremony marked a significant milestone in the religious community, involving the consecration of 25 individuals as clergy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DATA ANALYSIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Data Analysis refers to the process of examining, cleaning, transforming, and modeling data to discover useful information, inform conclusions, and support decision-making."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RELIGIOUS COMMUNITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Religious Community includes all the individuals and organizations involved in the ordination ceremony and the broader religious context."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PATENT FILING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Patent Filing, US patent 11256687, marks a significant milestone in the development and recognition of the 'surfacing relationships between datasets' technique."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DATA POINTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Data Points refer to individual pieces of information collected during the ordination ceremony, such as candidates' backgrounds, skills, and spiritual journeys."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VAST AMOUNTS OF DATA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Vast Amounts of Data include all the information analyzed during the ordination ceremony, which was processed using the 'surfacing relationships between datasets' technique."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HIDDEN PATTERNS AND CORRELATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hidden Patterns and Correlations are the insights discovered through the application of the 'surfacing relationships between datasets' technique, which helped identify suitable candidates for the clergy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DATA VISUALIZATION TECHNIQUES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Data Visualization Techniques are used to represent data in a visual format, helping to identify and understand hidden relationships between datasets."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ADVANCED ALGORITHMS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Advanced Algorithms are the computational methods used to process and analyze the vast amounts of data, enabling the identification of hidden relationships."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CASE STUDIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Case Studies demonstrate the effectiveness of the 'surfacing relationships between datasets' technique in various scenarios, providing evidence of its utility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Case studies are used as supporting evidence for the system's efficacy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SIMULATION RESULTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Simulation Results provide empirical evidence of the 'surfacing relationships between datasets' technique's performance and reliability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Simulation results are used as supporting evidence for the system's efficacy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DATA SCIENTISTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Data Scientists are the professionals who developed and applied the 'surfacing relationships between datasets' technique, including Dr. Rachel Kim."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MACHINE LEARNING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Machine Learning is a subset of artificial intelligence that focuses on building systems that can learn from and make predictions on data without being explicitly programmed."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PATTERN RECOGNITION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pattern Recognition involves identifying patterns or regularities in data, which is crucial for the 'surfacing relationships between datasets' technique."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DATA STRUCTURES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Data Structures are the ways in which data is organized and stored, which are essential for the effective application of the 'surfacing relationships between datasets' technique."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data structures are part of the novel approach detailed in the patent application."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DATA ANALYSIS COMMUNITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Data Analysis Community includes researchers, scientists, and experts in the field of data analysis, who were impacted by the 'surfacing relationships between datasets' technique."&lt;SEP&gt;"The data analysis community is a group of professionals and researchers who analyze and interpret data."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HEALTHCARE&quot;">
